  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, add the water and bring to the boil.\n• Add jasmine rice. Stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 12 minutes, then remove pan from heat.\n• Keep covered until rice is tender and all the water is absorbed, 10-15 minutes.\n• TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e22699f8f6928425d5c2fc/step-140aa300.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut japanese tofu into 2cm chunks.\n• In a shallow bowl, combine the plain flour and the salt. In a second shallow bowl, whisk some of the egg (1 for 2 people / 2 for 4 people). In a third shallow bowl, place panko breadcrumbs.\n• Dip tofu into flour mixture to coat, then into the egg and finally in breadcrumbs. Set aside on a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e22699f8f6928425d5c2fc/step-913cf610.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice spring onion.\n• In a medium bowl, add the remaining egg (2 for 2 people / 4 for 4 people), spring onion and the soy sauce (for the egg). Whisk to combine.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium heat. Add egg mixture to pan, then allow to set around the edges, 1 minute.\n• Gently fold the omelette and allow to finish cooking through, 1 minute. Transfer to a second plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e22699f8f6928425d5c2fc/step-be1ffe20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return frying pan to medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base. When oil is hot, cook the crumbed tofu until golden, 2-3 minutes each side. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e22699f8f6928425d5c2fc/step-54682e30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Combine shredded cabbage mix and Japanese dressing in a second medium bowl. Season to taste, then set aside.\n• In a small bowl, combine sesame dressing and the soy sauce (for the dressing). Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e22699f8f6928425d5c2fc/step-eff4b840.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice spring onion omelette in half.\n• Divide rice and Japanese slaw between plates. Top with spring onion omelette and tofu. Drizzle with sesame-soy dressing.\n• Garnish with pickled ginger to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e22699f8f6928425d5c2fc/step-caba8950.jpg"
    }
  ]
